        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_push" edge="1" parent="1" source="gha" target="ecr" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=default;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="docker push (agent image)">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.3" y="0" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="540" y="2175" />
              <mxPoint x="540" y="2262" />
              <mxPoint x="2745" y="2262" />
              <mxPoint x="2745" y="80" />
              <mxPoint x="2470" y="80" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0050EF;" value="How it works" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="6" width="520" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Upload or link.&lt;/b&gt; The owner signs in (Cognito) and pastes a YouTube, Twitch or Kick link, or uploads a video with a presigned PUT straight to S3. The web app calls the HTTP API with its JWT." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="60" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Job flow starts.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-api&lt;/code&gt; stores the job and starts the durable &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-job-flow&lt;/code&gt; (async invoke on alias &lt;i&gt;live&lt;/i&gt;, idempotent name &lt;code&gt;job-{jobId}-{run}&lt;/code&gt;)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="150" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. The agent works.&lt;/b&gt; The job flow creates a callback and starts the AgentCore session. The agent downloads audio, runs Transcribe, asks Claude Fable 5.1 for 5-10 moments, renders clips with ffmpeg and writes them to S3 and DynamoDB. It heartbeats the callback; success or failure resumes the flow. 15 minutes without a heartbeat fails the job (no watchdog)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="240" width="520" height="104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Live updates.&lt;/b&gt; Every job, clip, post and learning change flows through the DynamoDB stream to &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-broadcast&lt;/code&gt;, which pushes it over the WebSocket API to the owner's open apps. The token is checked on &lt;code&gt;$connect&lt;/code&gt;. Polling only while disconnected." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="362" width="520" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Review and Keep.&lt;/b&gt; The owner watches each clip, sees similar clips that did well, edits captions and presses Keep (or Throw away). Keep writes the posts in one transaction and starts the durable &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-clip-flow&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;clip-{clipId}-{run}&lt;/code&gt;)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="468" width="520" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Publish, wait 48 h, learn.&lt;/b&gt; The clip flow publishes each queued post (phase 2), waits 48 hours without compute, reads the numbers, asks Claude for one short learning and marks the clip's vector &lt;i&gt;performed&lt;/i&gt;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="574" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Vectors feed the agent.&lt;/b&gt; Before choosing moments, the agent embeds the new source with Titan V2 and queries S3 Vectors for the owner's 8 most similar performed clips: &quot;What worked before&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="664" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Webhooks.&lt;/b&gt; Platforms call the public REST API (throttled, no query strings logged); &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-hooks&lt;/code&gt; answers challenges with the SSM verify token and stores events." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="754" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend.&lt;/b&gt; Solid arrow = request or data flow built now; dashed = callback, image pull, option or phase 2. Bold numbers match the steps above. OpenSearch Serverless is drawn dashed because it is not deployed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="1024" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="evr" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.eventbridge;fillColor=#E7157B;" value=" " vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="842" y="1640" width="56" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="evr_t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;cf-prod-stats rule (EventBridge)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;rate(15 minutes)&lt;/code&gt; = the smallest &lt;code&gt;minIntervalMinutes&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;config/platforms.json&lt;/code&gt;; each post still waits its own interval" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="1700" width="260" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stats" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;fillColor=#ED7100;" value=" " vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1242" y="1640" width="56" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stats_t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;cf-prod-stats (Lambda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt; poller + manual refresh: due posts from gsi2, reserve the platform budget, fetch in batches, write metrics + STAT#; 256 MB, 300 s, retries 0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1140" y="1700" width="250" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="learn" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;fillColor=#ED7100;" value=" " vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1642" y="1640" width="56" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="learn_t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;cf-prod-learn (Lambda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt; the owner's best-of-week picks: vectors &lt;i&gt;best&lt;/i&gt; true/false, one &quot;Best of week&quot; learning (WEEK#, LEARNING#); 512 MB, 300 s, retries 1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1545" y="1700" width="250" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="statapis" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=none;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Platform stats APIs (tokens in phase 2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;YouTube Data + Analytics · TikTok video query · Instagram + Facebook Graph insights · X posts lookup&lt;br&gt;every 15 min: YouTube, TikTok, X; every 30 min: Instagram, Facebook" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2442" y="1790" width="280" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8a" edge="1" parent="1" source="evr" target="stats" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt; tick every 15 min">
