        <mxCell id="hw9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Numbers refresh.&lt;/b&gt; An EventBridge rule ticks every 15 minutes; &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-stats&lt;/code&gt; reads the posts that are due (each platform no faster than its safe interval: YouTube, TikTok, X 15 min; Instagram, Facebook 30 min; slower as posts age; 30 days, then a final snapshot). Refresh numbers on the clip page invokes it at once, inside the same budgets." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="844" width="520" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;9. Best of the week.&lt;/b&gt; The owner stars the week's best clips; &lt;code&gt;cf-prod-learn&lt;/code&gt; marks their vectors &lt;i&gt;best&lt;/i&gt; and asks Claude Fable 5.1 for one &quot;Best of week&quot; learning the agent reads first." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2820" y="944" width="520" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
